{"completed": true, "response": "既然他还不知道自己到底在怕什么，就先由着自己喜欢那个人，不急着想这份喜欢以后会变成什么。他现在可以先和那个人好好相处，两个人以后会怎样，往后再看。喜欢对方，也不代表他就得盼着对方给自己什么。这样一想，他慢慢能放心地和那个人亲近了。\n\n他很喜欢这种感觉。他可以把心里的温柔自然地给对方，也不用总惦记着对方有没有感受到。那个人对他很重要，可他和对方相处时还是能放松。有时他甚至觉得，自己比以前更自在了。原来把一个人放进心里，也不一定会让自己心慌。他可以认真地在乎那个人，不用急着把两个人的关系抓紧。\n\n这份快乐确实让他心里踏实了。他慢慢开始放心地喜欢那个人，甚至有点满意自己能这么平和地喜欢一个人。要是两个人能一直这样自然地亲近，许多事都能随着相处慢慢来，彼此少些追问和计较，那该多好。他当时觉得，这样就已经够了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b9521abc-56cd-4814-b51b-dfca9e0202c0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002144085397Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.812, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:23:19.909716+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0d5320f8dcf55caee4ae4118054b03bb582468ec925ca44e2ef011f5b4809243", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002144085397Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "289afc775ecefece83141d775cc6b6589a194fc26ed03712ba0dbe8ed707bb73"}}}
